 opts:["Polyethylene glycol – bulk-forming laxative","Duchenne muscular dystrophy – oral prednisolone","Alagille syndrome – paucity of interlobular bile ducts","Asthma – wheezing apart from colds","Biliary atresia – Kasai portoenterostomy"],
